,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"It seems like the most recent changes to the curl port has broken the \"tool\" feature package installation:\r\n\r\n==================================\r\nC:\\vcpkgtest2>vcpkg install curl[tool] --featurepackages\r\nThe following packages will be built and installed:\r\n    curl[core,ssl,tool,winssl]:x86-windows\r\nStarting package 1/1: curl:x86-windows\r\nBuilding package curl[core,ssl,tool,winssl]:x86-windows...\r\n-- Using cached C:/vcpkgtest2/downloads/curl-curl-curl-7_65_0.tar.gz\r\n-- Using source at C:/vcpkgtest2/buildtrees/curl/src/url-7_65_0-51a6e078ba\r\n-- Configuring x86-windows\r\n-- Building x86-windows-dbg\r\n-- Building x86-windows-rel\r\n-- Installing: C:/vcpkgtest2/packages/curl_x86-windows/share/curl/copyright\r\nCMake Error at ports/curl/portfile.cmake:137 (file):\r\n  file failed to open for reading (No such file or directory):\r\n\r\n    C:/vcpkgtest2/packages/curl_x86-windows/share/curl/curl-target-release.cmake\r\nCall Stack (most recent call first):\r\n  scripts/ports.cmake:71 (include)\r\n\r\n\r\nError: Building package curl:x86-windows failed with: BUILD_FAILED\r\nPlease ensure you're using the latest portfiles with `.\\vcpkg update`, then\r\nsubmit an issue at https://github.com/Microsoft/vcpkg/issues including:\r\n  Package: curl:x86-windows\r\n  Vcpkg version: 2018.11.23-nohash\r\n\r\nAdditionally, attach any relevant sections from the log files above.\r\n\r\n==================================\r\n\r\nWe have a nightly build which failed when https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/pull/6429 was merged in. Editing the file ports/curl/portfile.cmake file to rename curl-target-release.cmake to CURLTarget-release.cmake fixes this.","closed_by":{"login":"PhoebeHui","id":20694052,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjk0MDUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20694052?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhoebeHui","html_url":"https://github.com/PhoebeHui","fo